## 📝 Migration Notes

### Database Migration Required

The Decimal migration requires an Alembic migration to change Float columns to Numeric(18, 8):
- `aitbc.usage_records.quantity/unit_price/total_cost` → `Numeric(18, 8)`

**Rollback**: The migration includes a downgrade path. Existing float values will be converted to Decimal with 8 decimal places.

### Breaking Changes

None expected — all changes are internal. API contracts remain the same. The Decimal migration changes internal storage precision but does not affect API response formats (JSON serialization remains the same).
